OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of Seven Sisters flats
OL,4,Adevastating, residents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a town's tower blocks
OL,7,Fwhich are set to be demolished have
OL,8,Fsaid it is "devastating" but they will
OL,9,Fcontinue to "fight" the decision.
OL,11,FRochdale's Seven Sisters tower blocks,
OL,12,Fwhich contain 766 flats, will be
OL,13,Freplaced by about 600 homes, social
OL,14,Flandlord Rochdale Boroughwide Housing
OL,15,F(RBH) has said.
OL,17,FDemolition of the tower blocks was
OL,18,Ffirst proposed in 2017 but was ruled
OL,19,Fout in 2023 after a local campaign
OL,20,Fagainst it, but residents began moving
OL,21,Fout in October 2025 over long-term
OL,22,Fsafety concerns.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
