OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of Seven Sisters flats
OL,4,Adevastating, residents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoy Kitcher and Christina Hartley, who
OL,7,Fhave lived in one of the blocks for 14
OL,8,Fyears, said they were left "upset" and
OL,9,F"angry". RBH said demolition was the
OL,10,Fonly "realistic and affordable" option.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
